# Local dev default. Override per Vercel environment:
#   - Production project (cesto-web)         → https://cesto-api.onrender.com
#   - Staging project    (cesto-web-staging) → https://cesto-api-staging.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Google OAuth Web Client ID — same value as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID on the API.
# Get this at https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
# → OAuth 2.0 Client IDs → Web application. Add http://localhost:5199 (and
# your staging/prod origins) as authorized JavaScript origins.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Google Maps Geocoding API key — used to reverse-geocode the browser's
# navigator.geolocation coords into a city/postcode for the "Deliver to"
# navbar pill. Enable "Geocoding API" on the Google Cloud project, restrict
# the key to your web origins + HTTP referrers. Without it, the pill shows
# the "Set location" CTA and users have to pick manually.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
